  "$doc": [
    "Overture's places' `basic_category`, the kind a place tile carries: a kind",
    "crosses a tile as its place in CATEGORIES counted from 1, 0 for none, so a",
    "category is appended and one moved or taken out renumbers every tile made",
    "before. The values the geo database holds of the release it was ingested",
    "from; a release whose taxonomy moved is a purge by command, and a category",
    "missing here is a place with no kind, which no theme row draws."
